{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2016-01", "window": 2, "start_date": 1452211200, "end_date": 1452902399, "month_true_total": 1397, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:53:54 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "20549922", "author": {"steamid": "76561198101899635", "personaname": "Flowery", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198101899635/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 6118, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 655, "last_played": 1764464770, "avatar": "b231d3e196b119f6dcfd7aac9aaeeb47b36ed653"}, "language": "english", "review": "i recomend this game but there are lots of glitches and im having problems with it so i cant play it right now", "timestamp_created": 1452901911, "timestamp_updated": 1452901911, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47826087474822998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20549583", "author": {"steamid": "76561198100325008", "personaname": "GOTL", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gotltltl/", "num_games_owned": 411, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 67573, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 50240, "last_played": 1714883530, "avatar": "a83226f232d003fec03ec55e1cd44a534cbe8ed4"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you can sit still, grab a book to read and spam keys like a madman, then yes, this is THE GAME for you.\n\nYou can still rekt 'em all with cool as **** weapons (especially dem melee) though, so that's a bonus.\n\nBored of LoL or have enough playing with ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥? This is the game for you: Helpful and friendly community, sometimes giveaway things for free or less price because you're new etc. \n\nJust play the game long enough and you'll see yourself getting addicted to it. You can get burned out a bit once in a while, but if so just log in daily for the rewards and wait for the big update to get yourself addicted again!", "timestamp_created": 1452900568, "timestamp_updated": 1452900568, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20549009", "author": {"steamid": "76561198115181281", "personaname": "Rainbow", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/drakestraid/", "num_games_owned": 226, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 81050, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 47640, "last_played": 1770685685, "avatar": "7d092be35bbc5e62e4965e76bddd2ea77631a112"}, "language": "english", "review": "With over 800 hours in this game its safe to say its AWESOME.\n\nPros:\n-Stable game engine (hardly any FPS drops with thousands of particles on-screen)\n-Great community (not \"minecwaft pwoz\")\n-LOTS of new content! (i think there's been 3 new weapons added in 2016 as of January 15)\n-Great trading economy (unless you're poor like me, lol)\n-Excellent Free-To-Play model. (No paywalls; all items unlockable through alerts, playing missions, trading, or crafting.)\n\nCons:\n-Not available on all platforms (there are ways to get this to run on Wine in Linux Ubuntu, but they're decently complicated.)\n-RNGesus hates me...\n\nWAY better than Destiny. And best of all... ITS FREE!", "timestamp_created": 1452898304, "timestamp_updated": 1471553229, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.538461565971374512", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20548897", "author": {"steamid": "76561198154399177", "personaname": "55th Century Scholar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nexphilim/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 32999, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2937, "last_played": 1587258602, "avatar": "32c1cb55ed463767977cc9f3edd8a7b0d285d69d"}, "language": "english", "review": "-Double jump in air\n-Aim your bow at target\n-Shoot arrow \n-Dodge enemy fire in air\n-Arrow hits, headshot\n\nI got an instant orgasm from this. 10/10, Ninjas in space.", "timestamp_created": 1452897883, "timestamp_updated": 1563014979, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "20548231", "author": {"steamid": "76561198112775880", "personaname": "996", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kennethyeah/", "num_games_owned": 326, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 190085, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 134925, "last_played": 1658807903, "avatar": "752eb38c3b0bc6f74708ec2c3d44d00bda41edde"}, "language": "english", "review": "After testing this game out, i'd say it's aight.", "timestamp_created": 1452895581, "timestamp_updated": 1630640255, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54356849193572998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}